@baseUrl = http://localhost:5095

### Paged log of every call that completed or was rejected (defaults: page=1, pageSize=25).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/travel-history
Accept: application/json

### With explicit paging.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/travel-history?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Validation error: page size over the max (100).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/travel-history?page=1&pageSize=500
Accept: application/json
